{"id":"n16482-1-7","stage":5,"title":"상인 · 商贩","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16482-1-7-1","ko":"길에서 물건을 판매하는 노점 상인들에 대한 단속이 강화된대요.","zh":"据说，针对在街上卖东西的摊贩的执法力度要加强了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길에서","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길에서","audio":"/audio/7b6f145fabae17d5ad11.mp3"}},{"text":"물건을","meaning":"商品，物品","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건을","audio":"/audio/9f0ff175ca9f394f7144.mp3"}},{"text":"판매하는","meaning":"销售，经销","explanation":"판매하다：销售，经销；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"판매하다","audio":"/audio/d74f953880919bad897b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71311","senseId":"1","lemma":"판매하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"판매하는","audio":"/audio/adf262bf844a11c0bc8e.mp3"}},{"text":"노점","meaning":"摊，地摊","explanation":"노점：摊，地摊。","readings":[{"term":"노점","audio":"/audio/08f9494ade4b5816d0bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42902","senseId":"1","lemma":"노점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노점","audio":"/audio/08f9494ade4b5816d0bc.mp3"}},{"text":"상인들에","meaning":"商贩，商人","explanation":"상인：商贩，商人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"상인","audio":"/audio/ff557154223e9498c4a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16482","senseId":"1","lemma":"상인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상인들에","audio":"/audio/b6b27bd51f2c88e3fb5c.mp3"}},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대한","audio":"/audio/1d9b6fadeae799dde72f.mp3"}},{"text":"단속이","meaning":"管制，查处，严打","explanation":"단속：管制，查处，严打；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"단속","audio":"/audio/9bd78a2e1a6a6a48195a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42203","senseId":"2","lemma":"단속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단속이","audio":"/audio/8f7e930ef5431c2fabde.mp3"}},{"text":"강화된대요.","meaning":"被强化，被加强","explanation":"강화되다：被强化，被加强；ㄴ대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"강화되다","audio":"/audio/199b5ec0df978f701eaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22754","senseId":"1","lemma":"강화되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강화된대요","audio":"/audio/6035fad8089feda9c37c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"d74f953880919bad","term":"판매하다","zh":"销售，经销","audio":"/audio/d74f953880919bad897b.mp3","entryId":"71311","definition":"出售商品。","pronunciation":["판매하다"]},{"id":"08f9494ade4b5816","term":"노점","zh":"摊，地摊","audio":"/audio/08f9494ade4b5816d0bc.mp3","entryId":"42902","definition":"临时把货物摆在路边或空地上做生意的地方。","pronunciation":["노점"]},{"id":"ff557154223e9498","term":"상인","zh":"商贩，商人","audio":"/audio/ff557154223e9498c4a6.mp3","entryId":"16482","definition":"做生意的人。","pronunciation":["상인"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"9bd78a2e1a6a6a48","term":"단속","zh":"管制，查处，严打","audio":"/audio/9bd78a2e1a6a6a48195a.mp3","entryId":"42203","definition":"加以控制，以免违反法律、规定、命令等。","pronunciation":["단속"]},{"id":"199b5ec0df978f70","term":"강화되다","zh":"被强化，被加强","audio":"/audio/199b5ec0df978f701eaf.mp3","entryId":"22754","definition":"势力或力量变得更强。","pronunciation":["강화되다","강화뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2bb956b29fd88e3a32d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16482-1-7-2","ko":"상인 협회에서 대응책을 마련해야겠는데요?","zh":"商协会是不是该想些应对措施呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"상인","meaning":"商贩，商人","explanation":"상인：商贩，商人。","readings":[{"term":"상인","audio":"/audio/ff557154223e9498c4a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16482","senseId":"1","lemma":"상인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상인","audio":"/audio/ff557154223e9498c4a6.mp3"}},{"text":"협회에서","meaning":"协会","explanation":"협회：协会；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"협회","audio":"/audio/678449a5835f45cb5d13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85695","senseId":"1","lemma":"협회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"협회에서","audio":"/audio/f12fe3849d567c12e1b7.mp3"}},{"text":"대응책을","meaning":"对策","explanation":"대응책：对策；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대응책","audio":"/audio/b00e55fc6b4a0b17368f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47029","senseId":"1","lemma":"대응책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대응책을","audio":"/audio/dd8d37d0f6c8a3f7ada0.mp3"}},{"text":"마련해야겠는데요?","meaning":"筹备，安排","explanation":"마련하다：筹备，安排；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"마련하다","audio":"/audio/7b8d937526514876c83f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59463","senseId":"2","lemma":"마련하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마련해야겠는데요","audio":"/audio/6bfd600c124f54787bbb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ff557154223e9498","term":"상인","zh":"商贩，商人","audio":"/audio/ff557154223e9498c4a6.mp3","entryId":"16482","definition":"做生意的人。","pronunciation":["상인"]},{"id":"678449a5835f45cb","term":"협회","zh":"协会","audio":"/audio/678449a5835f45cb5d13.mp3","entryId":"85695","definition":"怀有相同目的的人组成的集会。","pronunciation":["혀푀","혀풰"]},{"id":"b00e55fc6b4a0b17","term":"대응책","zh":"对策","audio":"/audio/b00e55fc6b4a0b17368f.mp3","entryId":"47029","definition":"为了采取符合某种情况的态度或行动而准备的对策。","pronunciation":["대ː응책"]},{"id":"7b8d937526514876","term":"마련하다","zh":"筹备，安排","audio":"/audio/7b8d937526514876c83f.mp3","entryId":"59463","definition":"为预防某个情况而整理好了计划或想法。","pronunciation":["마련하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e8d36875c65bef0f0903.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.993,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16482","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":179,"sequenceScore":6.8197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["商协会是不是该想些应对措施呢？","据说有个无名作家因为生活困苦而苦苦挣扎，最终英年早逝了。","据说，针对在街上卖东西的摊贩的执法力度要加强了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["商协会是不是该想些应对措施呢？","据说，针对在街上卖东西的摊贩的执法力度要加强了。","据说有个无名作家因为生活困苦而苦苦挣扎，最终英年早逝了。"],"answer":0}]}
